                "title": "Octagon Knob with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Octagon Knob with Square Rose has a unique shape that makes this modern door knob a must have for trend setters. The best decorators know that interesting details like this Octagon Stainless Steel Knob with Square Rose is what helps bring personal style into a home. This contemporary stainless steel knob will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-3/4 inch thick doors with either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
